EN:
People who don't appreciate fossils{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
might just think they're oversized
bones, but {{TAG:0003:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}I still love 'em!

IT:
Quelli che non apprezzano i fossili{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
pensano che siano solo delle vecchie
ossa, {{TAG:0003:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}ma a me piacciono un sacco!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Todavía nos faltan muchas piezas,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
pero la colección va bastante bien,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¿no te parece?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Espero que siga así la cosa!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Certo, mancano alcuni pezzi,
ma in generale penso che siamo
abbastanza avanti, non credi?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}A me questi fossili piacciono da
matti. Quando vengo qui, mi sento
subito ringiovanito!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}La colección del pueblo está
bastante completa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¿no crees?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Solo faltan algunas piezas.
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Si los dinosaurios cobraran vida
y empezaran a corretear por ahí{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¡Sería como vivir en la prehistoria!
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Qué quiere decir esa sonrisita?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}¡No soy tan viejo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}This place is just getting started,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
but there still aren't enough fossils!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}You gotta think in the long term!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Esto por ahora está casi vacío.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
¡Hay que ser paciente!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡Y pensar en el futuro!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Questo museo sta appena iniziando{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
ad accettare donazioni di fossili.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bisogna avere pazienza...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Burası daha yeni başlıyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} ama hâlâ
yeterince fosil yok!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Uzun vadeli düşünmek lazım!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}We have some holes here and there,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
but our collection is growing pretty
quickly! {{TAG:0003:0001:}}These fossils are so cool!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Aún faltan piezas importantes,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
pero la colección ha ido creciendo
a buen ritmo.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿O tú qué opinas?

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Il y a quelques trous ici et là, mais
notre collection se porte bien.{{TAG:0003:0001:}} 
J'adore les fossiles.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Manca un ossetto qua e là,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ma in generale ci siamo quasi!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Troppo forti, questi fossili!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Şurada burada boşluklar var,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama koleksiyonumuz bayağı hızlı büyüyor!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu fosiller çok havalı!

EN:
How many fossils does {{TAG:0003:0017:}}the museum
in your town have?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}We're just a step away from a
totally complete collection!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
Combien de fossiles y a-t-il{{TAG:0003:0017:}} dans le
musée de ta ville ?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ici, on n'est pas loin de réunir la 
collection complète !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
Quanti fossili ha {{TAG:0003:0017:}}il museo
della tua città?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}A noi manca pochissimo per
completare la collezione!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
Wie viele Fossilien besitzt {{TAG:0003:0017:}}das
Museum in deiner Stadt?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bei uns fehlt nicht mehr
viel zur Perfektion!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}BWA HA HA HA HA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Senin kasabandaki müzede kaç fosil
var?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Biz tam koleksiyona sadece
bir adım uzaktayız!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}So? Impressive, right?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} We've got
every single fossil ever discovered
right here in our town's museum!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Go ahead and stare all you like!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Impresionante, ¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} No se ha
descubierto un solo fósil que
no esté aquí expuesto.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Míralos hasta que te hartes,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
que no se gastan.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Impressionnant, non ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} On a tous les
fossiles possibles et imaginables
dans notre musée.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Tu peux les regarder fixement !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Allora?! Bello, no?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Qui al nostro
museo abbiamo ogni singolo fossile
mai trovato sulla faccia della terra!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Prego, guarda pure quanto ti pare!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tanto di qui non scappano!
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Na? Beeindruckt?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wir haben alles,
was man hier in der Gegend so
ausbuddeln kann.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Die Kinnlade musst du jetzt aber
selbst wieder einrenken!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}BWA HA HA HA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Nasıl? Etkileyici, değil mi?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Şimdiye
kadar keşfedilen bütün fosiller
kasabamızın müzesinde!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}İstediğin kadar bak!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
